\section*{Public Mission Statement}

I choose to try --- not because I expect perfection,  
and not because I believe I can solve everything alone,  
but because doing nothing would betray who I am.

Trying is how I show up for people and families affected by these diseases.  
It is how I contribute, how I learn, and how I move forward with purpose.

I accept that I may fail in outcomes,  
but I refuse to fail by standing still.

My commitment is simple and grounded:
\begin{itemize}
  \item to keep working,
  \item to keep learning,
  \item to keep pushing toward something better.
\end{itemize}

Trying is how I honor the lives touched by this disease.  
Trying is how I stay true to myself.  
Trying is how I make sure I never look back wishing I had done more.

This is my mission.  
This is my choice.  
This is my commitment.

